:name: STM32G431 (bare chip)
:description: rtoos firmware on an STM32G431xB, console USART1. Set $bin to the ELF to run.

$name?="stm32g431"
$bin?=@build/arm-g431/apps/stm32g431/g431_selftest.elf

using sysbus
mach create $name
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ORIGIN/stm32g431.repl

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
    cpu VectorTableOffset 0x08000000
"""
runMacro $reset
